        "category": "tooling",
        "title": "Project-service lint of new top-level source trees",
        "detail": "Adding a directory such as shared/ that is not in the template layout is invisible to ESLint until a nested tsconfig.json exists. The first failure is a project-service parse error on every file, not a real rule.",
